<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Chunk> rdfs:subClassOf [ a logic:Restriction ; logic:onProperty <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkOf> ; logic:someValuesFrom logic:Thing ] .
